  "description_original": "Modern Designer Apartment with Garage Parking Near Podgorica City Centre\nAvailable for long-term rent, this thoughtfully designed one-bedroom apartment is located in a modern residential building just 1 km from Hilton Hotel and Podgorica city centre.\nThe apartment has been furnished with particular attention to detail, combining contemporary design, comfort, and functionality. High-quality Bosch appliances, carefully selected furniture, and elegant interior finishes create a refined living environment suitable for professionals, couples, or anyone looking for a home that offers more than standard rental accommodation.\nThe property includes a private garage parking space within the building and benefits from an excellent location. A gym, cafés, shops, and other everyday amenities are all within a short walking distance, while the city centre can be reached on foot in just a few minutes.\nIts position also provides quick and convenient access to the main routes towards both the Montenegrin coast and the northern region of the country, making it ideal for residents who value connectivity without sacrificing urban convenience.\nThe apartment comprises a spacious living room with dining area, a fully equipped kitchen, one bedroom, a modern bathroom, and a balcony with an open view.\nKey Features • One-bedroom apartment\n• Designer interior and premium furnishings\n• Bosch appliances throughout\n• Private garage parking space\n• New residential building\n• 1 km from Hilton Hotel and city centre\n• Gym, cafés, and shops within 100 m\n• Excellent access to the coast and northern Montenegro\n• Walking distance to the city centre\n• Available immediately for long-term rent",
